# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# Derived crop outputs (coffeecv/crop_tray.py) are 100% regenerable from the
# raw photos + code, so don't version them -- only the raw captures below.
# CAVEAT (found 2026-08-09): "regenerable" is true in principle but nothing
# automates it -- crop_tray.py is not a dvc.yaml stage -- while training reads
# *only* these crops. So the pipeline cannot run anywhere the crops don't
# already sit in the working tree. See the dvc exp run finding in
# EXPERIMENTS_LOG.md.
**/cropped/

# Python bytecode. `coffeecv` is a dep of the train stage, so without this every
# run rewrites .pyc files, changes the directory hash, and makes DVC report the
# stage as changed when no source file changed.
__pycache__/
